# WasmEnableThreads (BlazorCodeFirst.Samples.HeighwayDragon.csproj) makes the .NET heap a
# SharedArrayBuffer, which a browser only grants to a cross-origin-isolated page. These two
# headers are what turn crossOriginIsolated on; every asset here is self-hosted, so COEP's
# require-corp finds nothing cross-origin to block.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
